			"notes": "## DuskAFK 1.0.2\n\nStyled Player List compatibility update.\n\n- Keeps AFK players visible in the tablist.\n- Forces AFK tab names and nametags to stay gray.\n- Prevents Styled Player List and scoreboard updates from replacing the AFK appearance.\n- Staff AFK remains true spectator mode while hiding the spectator indicator in the tablist.\n- Fixed a Java client protocol disconnect caused by using `/afk` repeatedly before moving."
		},
