			"notes": "## DuskAFK 1.0.0\n\nInitial server-side release for Minecraft 26.2.\n\n- No client installation required.\n- Automatic AFK after 5 minutes without movement.\n- `/afk` and `/staffafk` commands.\n- Optional LuckPerms permission: `duskafk.staffafk`.\n- Staff AFK uses spectator mode, restores the saved location and game mode, and does not appear as spectator in the tab list."
